# What never needs uploading.
#
# `vercel deploy` on CLI 50.x did not honour .gitignore here and tried to upload 1.3 GB, failing on
# "File size limit exceeded (100 MB)" — the webpack cache packs inside .next-build are individually
# larger than that. .gitignore lists .next-build on line 47; this file is what the CLI actually
# reads. Vercel builds from source, so none of it is needed anyway.

node_modules
.next
.next-build
out
build
coverage

# Local databases, keys and env files. Vercel injects its own.
.env*
!.env.example

# Local scratch and artefacts.
*.log
.DS_Store
/scripts/*.output

# Design references, brand exports and review screenshots. Local artefacts; the app never reads
# them, and they were two thirds of the upload.
/output
